---
# Java Observability Toolkit (JOT)

sensors: 

- name: banned-methods
  description: A banned method was called, banned methods are prohibited by Security Directive 27B/6
  methods:
  - java.lang.ProcessBuilder.<init>
  scopes:
  - org.junit.platform.commons.util.ReflectionUtils.invokeMethod
  block-when: true 
